   "id": "title",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# SerpentGuard AI — Milestone 2: Comprehensive Dataset EDA\n",
    "\n",
    "**Group 5 · IIT Madras DS and AI Lab · 2026 T3**  \n",
    "Team: Jayesh Bansal (lead) · Vikas · Puneet Bajaj · Manas Rastogi  \n",
    "Date: 29 October 2026 · Dataset: `puneetbajajiitm/serpentguard-m2-splits`\n",
    "\n",
    "Single-notebook EDA covering the full data pipeline, all 18 analysis sections, and modelling implications.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Item | Value |\n",
    "|------|-------|\n",
    "| Source | iNaturalist research-grade (built 24 Oct 2026) |\n",
    "| Species recorded in India | 289 |\n",
    "| Final dataset | 181,231 photos · 208 classes + 656 unknown pool |\n",
    "| Train / Val / Test / Test-extra | 129,241 / 25,639 / 7,305 / 18,390 |\n",
    "| WHO medically important classes | 17 (6 Cat 1 · 11 Cat 2) |\n",
    "| Unique photographers | 25,041 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "setup",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import matplotlib.ticker as mticker\n",
    "import matplotlib.patches as mpatches\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n",
    "\n",
    "WHO_COLORS = {\"1\": \"#e74c3c\", \"2\": \"#e67e22\", \"not_listed\": \"#2ecc71\"}\n",
    "WHO_LABELS = {\"1\": \"WHO Cat 1 (Critical)\", \"2\": \"WHO Cat 2 (Important)\", \"not_listed\": \"Not listed\"}\n",
    "SPLIT_COLORS = {\"train\": \"#3498db\", \"val\": \"#9b59b6\", \"test\": \"#e74c3c\",\n",
    "                \"test_extra\": \"#f39c12\", \"unknown_pool\": \"#95a5a6\"}\n",
    "FMT = mticker.FuncFormatter(lambda x, _: f\"{int(x):,}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams.update({\n",
    "    \"figure.dpi\": 120,\n",
    "    \"figure.facecolor\": \"white\",\n",
    "    \"axes.spines.top\": False,\n",
    "    \"axes.spines.right\": False,\n",
    "})\n",
    "print(\"Setup complete\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "dataload",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "KAGGLE_INPUT = Path(\"/kaggle/input/serpentguard-m2-splits\")\n",
